From: Andy <andylee77@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:09:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 20/22] cameras: Anpviz IPC-B8A63WD-S / UVision MC-F46D
 (ymf46d_ssc377d_gc4653)

SSC377D + GC4653, 2560x1440 + 960x540: orientation, the mic, IR and white
lights, GPIO IR-cut, microSD automount. Its own board DTS includes the wiring
it shares with the JL12D2 and adds its model string and lights, so a JL12D2
board change does not reach it. It boots under the stock OEM U-Boot and flash
layout, with the U-Boot env kept in a file. The RAPTOR_* keys are in
raptor.config. The OEM sensor tuning (gc4653.bin) is a vendor file and is not
included.
---
